repository-code: "https://github.com/contefranz/OpTop-R2-replication"
abstract: "Code, cached results and data behind every table, figure and reported number of 'Goodness-of-Fit Indices and Diagnostics for Topic Models' (Lewis and Grossetti) and its Supplementary Material: four simulation studies, the MD&A empirical application, the evaluation-only revision batch and the Stage 3 computations. Exhibits are regenerated exactly from the shipped caches and the result objects deposited on Zenodo. Code under MIT; data under CC0-1.0."
